<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT MINOR COUNTIES BY 9 RUNS IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT MINOR COUNTIES BY 9 RUNS IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>JESMOND, England 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Minor Counties by 9 runs in their 50 overs match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 290-7, Minor Counties 281-9</p>
